Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得爸爸希望我们走他的老路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think dad want us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救人猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,延续家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得传承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定因素在于血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有这样的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲有这样的血统  这是你们家族的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's blood, your family's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我喜欢约翰  -是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like that John kid. - You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我认为你们俩注定是一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think you two were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  约翰和玛丽·温彻斯特的结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the union of John and Mary Winchester --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天造的一对  最优先的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very big deal upstairs, top priority arrangement. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你撮合了我们的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that you fixed-up our parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命令说的很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The orders were very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨姆必须出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sam needed to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的父母是命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents were just meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是爸爸最宝贵的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dad's single most valuable possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他关于邪魔的全部知识都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he knows about every evil thing is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把这书留给了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's passed it on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说爸爸救过多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people do you think dad saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是他的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(伊利诺伊州  诺玛  1958年)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走之前来看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to check on you before I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天  我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, I'll tell you all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在乖乖睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道上课这么正式\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told me this initiation was a formal affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人提升点品味  是吧  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, someone had to class up the joint, right, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难的部分都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard part's over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑兹小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Sands?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让阿比顿拿到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let Abbadon get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of you is John Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, time is of the essence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们谁是约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of you is John Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's absolutely...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别烦我  我得想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证你们没必要动粗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you there's no need for violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们肯定有谁认识约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you must know John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们中谁从你家壁柜里掉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one of us falls out of your closet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你提问\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you can ask the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  你非得用手按着我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it absolutely essential, sir, that you keep your hands on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我完全不能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the absence of any and all other explanations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕这是一场不可思议的可怕的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid this has been a marvelous, tragic misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things of grave importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间应付你们这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have time to deal with the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪都别想去  邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere, 007...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先交待清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}...till we get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开我心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,2013年\N{\fnArial\fs30}2013.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来玛雅人说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess the mayans were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼光不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice taste in wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there with the holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我也能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是不想挨打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you can start by telling us everything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就老实说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I beat it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们是无法理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quite certain this is all beyond your understanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这装老大的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my alpha-male-monkey friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动用武力也不能帮你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And violence will not help you comprehend this any easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你我理解什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you what I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个混球从我衣柜里跌出来说要找我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some asshat pops out of my closet asking about my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还砸了我的车窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}smashes up my ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我为什么不对你动粗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why am I not getting violent, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·温彻斯特是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester is your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻小子  你忘记锁门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly man, you forgot to lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过咒语一直不是你的强项嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then spells never were your best subject, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖地把我要的东西交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you be a doll and give me what I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证给你和你的朋友个干净的了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise to kill you and your friends here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没那么坚强  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a fighter, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得抵抗她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must fight this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔茜略感不适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Josie's indisposed, pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以只有你和我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it's just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪能这么对待一位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is no way to treat a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你都看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我要退房\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I'm checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一般我经历的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all the adventures I enjoy 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是书上读来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}are usually of the literary nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吐也吐完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, now that you're done blowing chunks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能告诉我们那个复古美女是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to tell us who Betty Crocker was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd she come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她来自地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自伊利诺伊  诺玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Normal, Illinois --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1958年\N{\fnArial\fs30}1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯淡吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从汽车旅馆的壁柜里穿越时空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude's time traveling through motel-room closets?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:10:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就沦落到这个地步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we've come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们能带我去见约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just take me to John,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切误会肯定都能澄清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could clear all this up, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这与你何干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他驾照上写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver's license says
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是伊利诺伊诺玛的亨利·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's Henry Winchester from Normal, Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道爸爸的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows dad's birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他出生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the exact place where he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  那是我们爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说别急着跟他套近乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying before we break out the warm and toasties,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了那个书虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's not forget that, uh, H.G. Wells over there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在爸爸小时候就抛妻弃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}left dad high and dry when he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe he didn't run out on dad --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他是穿越来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he time-traveled here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就没能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, I don't know, got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论如何  爸爸讨厌那混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, either way, dad hated the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那爸爸是怎么弥补的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dad made up for that how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是年度最佳父亲了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By being father of the year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸虽然也有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dad had his issues, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他从没抛弃过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was always there for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最讨厌穿越了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I freaking hate time-travel, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟  不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, despite everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚认识了我的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just met my grandsons, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人感动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this has been touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来想想怎么给你收拾烂摊子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we figure out how to clean up your mess, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:12:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我捅她的时候她怎么没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how come she didn't die when I stabbed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为一般的刀具伤不了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because demons can't be killed by run-of-the-mill cutlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very least, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也得是用一把库尔德人的古弑魔刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd need an ancient demon-killing knife of the Kurds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是弑魔刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个恶魔给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我们干过很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been around this block so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用来穿越的那个传送门还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that portal or whatever it was you came through --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是开启的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it still open?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I highly doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想如果我们杀不了这个阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just thinking if we can't kill this Abbadon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许可以送她回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can shove her back where she came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blood sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血让我找到自己的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood leads to blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者他们的近亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or their next of kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是阿比顿也过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Abbadon came through it, also, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能再做一次血印吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can you create this blood sigil again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一片天使羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}an angel feather,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙之泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}tears of a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小撮时之沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pinch of the sands of time --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I would need those and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还得给我的灵魂一周的充电时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least a week for my soul to recharge,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但可以说是能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, yes, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你借用灵魂之力才到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tapped the power of your soul to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为只有天使才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought only angels could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩是什么级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What level are you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,级别\N{\fnArial\fs30}What level?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知识的级别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是记录者吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're men of letters, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对偶像组合有点生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little rusty on my boy bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:22.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你们的父亲  教你知识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}like your father, who taught you our ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的父亲教我们怎么猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father taught us how to be hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you? Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hunters are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎人只是粗人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters are apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么的传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legacies of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这让人受启发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, this was enlightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit the road, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他点时间  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a minute, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚开了四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just spent four hours driving, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这一路上就知道盯着窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he did was stare out the window 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还让我们放老歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and request Pat Boone on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我够耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是表象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a facade,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让敌人相信我们搬去了别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}a way to rook our enemies into believing we are housed elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  少装神秘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, enough with the decoder talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快告诉我们什么记录者是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you tell us what this whole men-of-letters business is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你就自己解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不管你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  就因为我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, because we're hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我们有什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了不假思索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aside from the unthinking, unwashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不问清楚就动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot-first-and-don't-bother-to- ask-questions-later part,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}not much, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是约翰的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're also John's children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more than that, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲和他的父亲都是记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father and his father before him were both men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰和你们俩也该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As John and you two should have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're preceptors,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旁观者\N{\fnArial\fs30}beholders,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录一切凡人不理解的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}chroniclers of all that which man does not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的发现只告诉几个可以信任的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We share our findings with a few trusted hunters --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些强中强手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就是我们绝地武士的尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're like Yodas to our Jedis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了  你迟早会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. You'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果你们那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but if you guys were such a big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们  还有我们认识的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why haven't we -- or anyone we know --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没听说过你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever heard of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿在我最后一课的时候袭击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon attacked us the night of my final initiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来我会知道一切秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}All secrets were to be revealed then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我理理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿越时空来保护一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You traveled through time to protect something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不知道是什么的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that does you don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让它被一个你不了解的恶魔偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a demon that you know nothing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的对讲机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me your... walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是说我的手机吗  -那更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean my phone? - Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接线员  给我接D457\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operator, I need delta 457.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想打给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you not calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的应急号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our emergency number.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛  现在不是那个号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不可能都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't all be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定还有长者在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be another elder out there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我们想办法打败阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can help us figure out how to stop Abbadon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们怎么处理盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what to do with the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借用一下你的电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we hijack your computer for a hot second?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这屋子里哪能装下电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you could fit a computer in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你来  -好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说个名字  任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a name -- anybody who, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚可能在场的长者\N{\fnArial\fs30}might have been there that night -- one of those elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大卫·阿克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...Ackers, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉里·加农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry Ganem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Ted --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1958年8月12日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, August 12, 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绅士俱乐部发生可怕的火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragic fire at a Gentlemen's Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地址是盖恩斯街242号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, 242 Gaines Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is 242 Gaines Street...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是灾难不是大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was no fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉里·加农  大卫·阿克斯  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry Ganem, David Ackers, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德·鲍恩和大阿尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ted Bowen, and Albert Magnus --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大阿尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albert Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比那还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mentors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵挡阿比顿最后的防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}our last defense against the Abbadons of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你朋友大阿尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your buddy Albert Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫大阿尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albertus Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他并不是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was hardly a buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是中世纪最伟大的炼金术士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the greatest alchemist of the middle ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他怎么埋在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so why is he buried here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要隐姓埋名时就用他的名字做假名\N{\fnArial\fs30}His was the alias we'd use when going incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想有人特意把他的名字放在那篇报道里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe someone planted his name in that article...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样如果有记录者来追查\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that if a man of letters came looking for answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就会知道有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd know something was amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么有人想让你来找这座坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So someone wanted you to come to this grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关键是他的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水瓶星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aquarian star,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代表了强大的魔法和力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}representing great magic and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说在亚特兰蒂斯的大门上也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it stood at the gates of Atlantis itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人的墓碑上都有  除了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on all the tombstones except for this one --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉里·加农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Larry Ganem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:17.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是海地人的标志  "对死人诉说"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Haitian symbol for speaking to the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们挖过坟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys ever exhume a body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真喜欢你的装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love what you've done with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.06,0:20:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来错日子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《魔女嘉莉》周日放映\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Carrie" Screening's on sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你服装真好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dig your costume, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你都看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借用一下你的电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we hijack your computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大卫·阿克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ackers, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉里·加农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry Ganem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可怕的火灾  -不是大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tragic fire. - That was no fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大阿尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albert Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(麦克林郡讣告记录)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(魔鬼逼我的)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your top.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我咱们是怎么走到这一步的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me how we got stuck doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一战老兵拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, was, uh, Larry a world war I vet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, who's the stiff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.87,0:22:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯里三世托马斯·J 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Thomas J. Carey iii.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某人想让你看到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody wanted you to see this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那个某人就是拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe that somebody is Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他在袭击中幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, maybe he, uh, survives the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且以这个人的身份隐匿起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hides out with this guy's identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把坑填上  我们上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover this up. Let's be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  我听过这个调\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? I know that tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"时光飞逝"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"As time goes by."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我没说错  这个来自卡萨布兰卡(摩洛哥西北部港市)\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so. It's from "Casablanca."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.87,0:22:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸时不时的会哼这首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad used to whistle it from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲一天晚上在路边的汽车影院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father saw "Abbott and costello meet the mummy"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了《两傻大战木乃伊》\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the drive-in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他吓得到魂都破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scared the beeswax out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.25,0:23:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我给他了一个播放这首歌的音乐盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got him this little music box that played that song
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.76,0:23:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他晚上入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help him sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.27,0:23:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, it's hard to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸也曾经怕过某些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was ever scared of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据县志记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to county records,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆·凯里住在堪萨斯州的黎巴嫩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Carey lives in Lebanon, Kansas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是个快乐的127岁的老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is a very happy 127-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们打个盹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we get some shut-eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天一大早就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}head over first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.43,0:23:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据爸爸的日志记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to dad's journal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经拷问过的一个恶魔说\N{\fnArial\fs30}he once tortured a demon that said
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己是为阿比顿卖命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made his bones working for Abbadon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果那个恶魔是一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, it turns out, is a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱骑士是路西法亲手挑选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell are hand-picked by Lucifer himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是第一代堕落天使  第一代恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are of the first-fallen, first-born demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以非常纯种  非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very pure, very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中说大天使把他们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it that archangels had killed all of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如同我们所见  事实并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, as we have witnessed, is not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.27,0:24:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她是仅剩的一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she's the last of her kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说这是你父亲的  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You say that belonged to your father? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.54,0:24:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一本猎人的日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hunter's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们记录者也写日志吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume men of letters...you use journals, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.65,0:24:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intended to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.69,0:24:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上课的前一天邮购了一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent away for one the day before my initiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.75,0:24:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上是从我名字的的首字母上判断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, judging by my initials here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.60,0:24:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信就是这本\N{\fnArial\fs30}this one, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.85,0:24:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这曾经是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have arrived after...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to gather
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这次没能回去  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make it back from this time, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.73,0:24:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.05,0:24:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道从那之后爸爸再也没见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we do know is that dad never saw you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.52,0:25:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he think happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以为你把他遗弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought you ran out on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰是一个传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}John was a legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.07,0:25:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本应该教他记录的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to teach him the ways of the letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他学的方式略有不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he learned things a little differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艰难坎坷的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在寂寞的童年中长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surviving a lonely childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.49,0:25:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有恶心的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}a stinking war...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.96,0:25:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不料自己的妻子被恶魔抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to get married and have his wife taken by a demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.32,0:25:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久就死在恶魔手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and later killed by one himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.59,0:25:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回回都遇到不公平的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man got a bum rap around every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他坚持走了下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.12,0:25:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他所做的好事远比做的坏事多\N{\fnArial\fs30}he did a hell of a lot more good than he did bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.37,0:25:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.87,0:25:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望我当时在他身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had been there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.44,0:26:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但你不觉得现在说这话有点晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a little late for that now, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.72,0:26:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们为了伟大事业所做出的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the price we pay for upholding great responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的责任在于你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your responsibility was to your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是什么美其名的读书俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not some glorified book club!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.18,0:26:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一名传人  我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a legacy. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你一直都是这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.26,0:27:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.91,0:27:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry -- he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.42,0:27:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他去哪了  -不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.15,0:27:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就留了张字条说他要去搞定一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just left a note saying he was gonna fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.17,0:27:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说搞砸一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or screw it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satnam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.42,0:27:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎  旅行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么可以帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.15,0:27:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要一滴龙的眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can use a tear of a dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少量时间之沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a pinch of the sands of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.14,0:27:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不用包起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't bother wrapping it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.70,0:27:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就要用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be using it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.78,0:27:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里不卖那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't carry those things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.57,0:27:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我推荐你用卡瓦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can I interest you in some kava root?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.30,0:27:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治焦虑有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great for anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的窗户上  是猎魔者的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your window -- hunters' signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁和你是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are and what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.03,0:28:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在把我的东西给我  我好上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give me what I need so I can be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.90,0:28:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是该上路了  陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be going, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.61,0:28:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.68,0:28:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不愿卖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're reluctant to sell to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.95,0:28:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在我走之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But please let me purchase some chamomile
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.58,0:28:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦卖给我一些甘菊治失眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my restless nights before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.84,0:28:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.23,0:28:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在知道他说"搞定一切"是什么意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know what he meant by "Fix everything."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.35,0:28:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他撬开车箱  偷走一片天使羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke in to the trunk, stole an angel feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他又要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing he's gonna whip up
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.02,0:28:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次血咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}another one of those blood spells
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把自己当成马蒂·麦夫莱(电影《回到未来》主角)飞回到50年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Marty Mcfly himself back to the 1950s.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.78,0:28:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.12,0:28:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱领主来之前阻止她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop abbadon before she strikes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.53,0:28:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者抓着爸爸开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or grab dad and haul ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.06,0:28:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  关键是他就要这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, point is he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还需要两样成分才能完成咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still needs two ingredients for the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.79,0:28:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非这附近有卖巫术品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless there's some place nearby that sells real hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.20,0:28:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给盖思打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.42,0:29:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有部门  星相漫画屋疑似杀人案  地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, possible homicide at astro comics. Location...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.79,0:29:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看呐  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.76,0:29:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好  星相漫画屋一人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just hit the wires -- one dead at astro comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿比顿吗  -应该是 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abbadon? - Yeah, has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.71,0:29:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  她接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so she's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找亨利  你找拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go find Henry. You find Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.10,0:29:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法杀掉这小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure out how to kill this chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.05,0:29:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  亨利死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Henry is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.54,0:29:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直肯定他活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so sure that -- that he had survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.63,0:29:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  像我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, um, like I said --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.46,0:29:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了他的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found his journal and was hoping
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能填补上空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could fill in the gaps
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.25,0:29:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我1958年那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and explain to me what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.44,0:29:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that night in 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.51,0:29:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都过去了  我们都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone. We're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.76,0:29:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可阿比顿没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Abbadon is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿是被雇用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon was a hired gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.12,0:29:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚她杀了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed us all that one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.83,0:29:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.45,0:29:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She blinded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:29:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的幸存是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.17,0:30:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她没得到她想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she did not get what she came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.34,0:30:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.58,0:30:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  阿比顿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Abbadon is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.32,0:30:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想要这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she wants this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要得知道关于它的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need to know everything there is to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.97,0:30:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盒子里有一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the box is the key
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通往所有的事物  卷轴  咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}to every object, scroll, spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几千年来收集的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever collected for thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.26,0:30:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都有一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}under one roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.31,0:30:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是凶鬼恶灵的母窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the supernatural mother lode.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.35,0:30:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.59,0:30:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a risk I have to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.27,0:30:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是死了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.07,0:30:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说你就能在这一跳中活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said you'll even survive a jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能理解我看完约翰的日记后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot begin to understand how I felt
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.75,0:30:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}after reading John's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.46,0:30:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.97,0:30:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看过的次数超出你的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I've read that thing more times than you can imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.12,0:31:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都会刺痛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it hurts every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.51,0:31:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是这样  但让他失望的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe so, but you didn't let him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.58,0:31:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我  就像你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did! Just like you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.65,0:31:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我说的不对  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I was wrong. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.70,0:31:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going to go back
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他应得的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give him the life he deserves,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是被迫选择的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}not the one he was forced to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是命中注定呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's not meant to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.42,0:31:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就变成命中注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.35,0:31:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能如此确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.33,0:31:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为就应该这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's the right thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.86,0:31:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能解救他  阻止阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save him and stop Abbadon!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.30,0:31:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.17,0:31:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到她攻击的一小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}By going back an hour before she attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.55,0:31:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做些准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and making preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.93,0:31:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样做  你会改变过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do that and you change the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.02,0:31:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆可能会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Sam might cease to exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.41,0:31:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道时间线很微妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware that time is a delicate mistress,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我愿意赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm willing to bet on this being for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.90,0:31:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白这不是你想象中的完美结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that this is not your idea of a happy ending, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.29,0:31:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你很失望  我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you're disappointed that me and Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.29,0:31:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是喘气的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}are mouth-breathing hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.63,0:31:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道吗  我们阻止了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? We stopped the Apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我的计划能够实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this works the way I planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.67,0:31:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就根本不会有天启存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will never be an Apocalypse to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.46,0:31:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.98,0:31:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿想要钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon wants the key
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.75,0:31:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样她就能拿到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she can get her hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象出她得到之后会干什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine what she would do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么才能阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.78,0:32:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样才能阻止阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop Abbadon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.03,0:32:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.54,0:32:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道钥匙的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know where the key is,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.69,0:32:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钥匙带到这个地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}then take it to these coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.99,0:32:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扔进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.25,0:32:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把大门永远关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the door forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.01,0:32:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  为什么我要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, w-why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.49,0:32:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是世界上最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it is the safest place on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.10,0:32:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能挡住所有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}warded against any evil ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何东西能闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is impervious to any entry,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}except the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.68,0:32:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  那样的话所有知识都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but then all that knowledge would be --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.85,0:32:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会永远的丢失\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be lost and gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.00,0:32:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我们必须付出的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is the price we have to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以免知识落入阿比顿手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}for keeping it away from ASbbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.48,0:33:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  的确有钥匙  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do... have the key, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.20,0:33:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我兄弟有\N{\fnArial\fs30}...my brother does.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没喝完你的茶呢  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't finished your tea, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.78,0:33:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.37,0:33:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些年不好过啊  拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The years have not been kind, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.93,0:33:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比他性感多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much sexier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.86,0:33:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.91,0:33:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿比顿  -好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abbadon. - Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.02,0:33:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen up -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.92,0:33:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做一个老式的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make a good, old-fashioned horse trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.76,0:33:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利和钥匙  换你兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry and the key for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.23,0:33:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然他就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听清了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.59,0:33:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清清楚楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.86,0:33:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拉里家的路上  有一座炼油厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the road to Larry's, there's a processing plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't keep me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.06,0:33:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿抓住萨姆了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon has Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.29,0:34:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想让我用你和钥匙来换萨姆的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to trade you and the key for Sam's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.91,0:34:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能回到过去  这些都不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just go back, stop this all from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你回不去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.58,0:34:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能冒险  现在萨姆命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take that risk -- not with Sammy on the hook now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.82,0:34:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能放弃我的儿子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't abandon my son, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.22,0:34:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能再次放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.39,0:34:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do this. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.55,0:34:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.22,0:34:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.10,0:34:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没觉得抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我们一见面你就想打晕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've wanted to do that since we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.87,0:34:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  你得明白一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, you need to understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.90,0:34:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸死的时候  我救不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my dad died, I couldn't save him...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.12,0:35:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我多想救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...no matter how bad I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.70,0:35:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会让这样的事情发生在萨姆身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never want that to happen to Sam...ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.17,0:35:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只有一丝救他的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a chance that I can save him,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.05,0:35:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我弟弟  他是我仅有的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother. He's the only family I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.99,0:35:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.95,0:35:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.55,0:35:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们猎人的毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem with you hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.18,0:35:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都目光短浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all short-sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  至少我们不会灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, at least we're not extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.22,0:35:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.09,0:35:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让亨利拿着盒子过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send Henry here over with the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.73,0:35:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也要交出萨姆  不许耍手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do the same with Sam. No tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只对亨利和钥匙感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only interest is Henry and the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.93,0:35:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩可以离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:36:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以自己走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.09,0:36:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你就得爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can do it crawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.89,0:36:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.14,0:36:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.29,0:36:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  不要这样  这计划真的不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Dean. This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.41,0:36:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.15,0:36:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.67,0:36:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.26,0:36:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.66,0:36:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.58,0:36:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-亨利  -等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry! - Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.72,0:36:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是唯一一个说谎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.22,0:36:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.57,0:36:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我弟弟  他是我唯一的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother. He's the only family I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.80,0:36:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你有什么想法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.23,0:36:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能拖住阿比顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you slow Abbadon down?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以  剩下的就交给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you can, I'll do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.44,0:37:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! What a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  快把盒子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, give me the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.54,0:37:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盒子在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.85,0:37:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.31,0:37:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以来硬的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.41,0:37:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么不能动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I stuck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.55,0:37:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把恶魔陷阱刻在子弹上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A devil's trap carved into the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.21,0:37:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得靠近点才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠近意味着场面可能会变得很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "close" means it could get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.22,0:37:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但是为了血脉必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But you do that for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是没能杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still didn't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.58,0:38:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是你会希望我们刚刚杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you'll wish we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.68,0:38:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身体里的恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon trap in your noggin
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.64,0:38:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了困住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna keep you from smoking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要把你碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna cut you into little steaks
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.44,0:38:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再把你的尸体埋入水泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bury each strip under cement.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.61,0:38:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许是不死之身  但是你会希望一死百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not be dead, but you'll wish you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.54,0:38:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.98,0:38:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.82,0:38:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  对你这种书呆子来说  干得很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a bookworm, that wasn't bad, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.99,0:38:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉之前对于你们是猎人的事说了很难听的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I judged you two so harshly for being hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.78,0:38:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该更懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.73,0:38:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是温彻斯特家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're also Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.04,0:38:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we're alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.54,0:38:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's always hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.44,0:38:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为男人  我不了解我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know my son as a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.23,0:39:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是见到了你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but having met you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我会为他引以为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I would have been proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(H·温彻斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.69,0:39:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.48,0:39:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.03,0:39:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丘比特说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cupid said
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.49,0:39:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂费尽心机撮合老爸老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}about heaven busting ass to get mom and dad together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.18,0:40:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特家和坎贝尔家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters and the Campbells --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.36,0:40:03.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,智者和勇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brains and the brawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.93,0:40:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.34,0:40:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家谱  我看到的都是死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I see in our family tree is a whole lot of dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.19,0:40:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在亨利的钱包里找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found this in Henry's wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.57,0:40:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸看起来很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.94,0:40:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这大概会让你希望他是知道真相的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes you wish he knew the truth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多年  一直以为他的老爸丢弃了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all those years thinking his old man ditched
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.19,0:40:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上他却来到了这里救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the poor son of a bitch really came here and saved our bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.86,0:40:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的时间穿梭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaking time-travel, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.93,0:40:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这会让一切变得不同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it would have made a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.34,0:40:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.01,0:40:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.87,0:40:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他有父亲陪伴他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he'd had his own father around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.09,0:40:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要如何抚养我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, in how he raised us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.55,0:41:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  他尽到全力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, he did the best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.23,0:41:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. I-I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.45,0:41:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方还存在的可能性有多大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the chances that place is still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.86,0:41:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  我们总得试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance we've got to take, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.95,0:41:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟  我们也是传人啊  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we are legacies, right?
